<section>
  <h2>Statutory contributions, itemised</h2>
  <p>Every guard on every client site is on our payroll with all statutory contributions paid monthly:</p>
  <ul class="check-list">
    <li><strong>EPF</strong> — employer share (13%) on basic wage, deposited monthly.</li>
    <li><strong>ESI</strong> — employer share (3.25%) on gross wage where applicable.</li>
    <li><strong>Professional Tax</strong> — deducted and remitted per West Bengal slabs.</li>
    <li><strong>Statutory bonus</strong> — provisioned monthly, paid annually (typically Durga Puja).</li>
    <li><strong>Gratuity</strong> — provisioned monthly per actuarial assessment.</li>
    <li><strong>Earned & sick leave</strong> — accrued per Shops & Establishments Act.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

